{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06376","headline":"题綦毋校书别业 · 李颀","name":"题綦毋校书别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常称挂冠吏，昨日归沧洲。\n行客暮帆远，主人庭树秋。\n岂伊问天命，但欲爲山游。\n万物我何有，白云空自幽。\n萧条江海上，日夕见丹丘。\n生事非渔钓，赏心随去留。\n惜哉旷微月，欲济无轻舟。\n倏忽令人老，相思河水流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}